{"title":"让产品首页更有高级感","html":"<main><div class=\"learning-lab-page\"><div class=\"learning-lab-shell\"><header class=\"learning-lab-topbar\"><nav class=\"detail-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><button class=\"breadcrumb-link\" type=\"button\">VibeHub Skill</button><span class=\"breadcrumb-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">组合练习</span></nav><span class=\"learning-generated\"><i class=\"ti ti-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Agent 组合了 4 个互动</span></header><section class=\"learning-intro\"><div class=\"learning-intro-context\">组合案例 · 准备上线的 AI 产品首页</div><h1>让产品首页更有高级感</h1><p>先比较做法，再决定第一眼要看到什么。调整完成以后，离开参数检查一次真实感受。</p><ol class=\"learning-route\" aria-label=\"练习步骤\"><li class=\"is-current\">看差异</li><li class=\"\">定下第一眼</li><li class=\"\">自己调整</li><li class=\"\">离开参数检查</li></ol></section><section class=\"learning-stage\" aria-label=\"组合互动练习\"><header class=\"learning-stage-header\"><div><small>正在练习 · 视觉层级</small><h2>先让首页说清楚一件事</h2></div><button class=\"learning-reset\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"ti ti-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>重来一次</button></header><div class=\"learning-product is-flat priority-value\" style=\"--learning-title:54px;--learning-gap:36px;--learning-muted:0.592\"><div class=\"learning-preview-caption\"><span>页面预览</span><b>内容差不多抢眼</b></div><header class=\"learning-product-nav\"><span class=\"learning-product-brand\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>示例页面</span><nav aria-label=\"示例页面导航\"><span>产品</span><span>案例</span><span>价格</span></nav><span class=\"learning-product-login\">登录</span></header><div class=\"learning-product-hero\"><div class=\"learning-product-copy\"><small>为独立创作者准备</small><h2>把想法变成<br>可以分享的作品</h2><p>从第一张画布到最终发布，把创作过程放进一个安静、顺手的工作空间。</p><div class=\"learning-product-actions\"><span>免费开始</span><span>看看作品</span></div><div class=\"learning-product-proof\"><span><b>12,800</b>位创作者正在使用</span><span><b>4.9</b>用户评分</span></div></div><div class=\"learning-product-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"learning-art-orbit orbit-one\"></div><div class=\"learning-art-orbit orbit-two\"></div><div class=\"learning-art-card card-back\"><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"learning-art-card card-front\"><i></i><strong>春日笔记</strong><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"learning-art-dot dot-one\"></div><div class=\"learning-art-dot dot-two\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"learning-compare-row\"><div class=\"learning-option-cards\" aria-label=\"选择页面方案\"><button class=\"is-active\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><small>方案 A</small><b>内容差不多抢眼</b><span>标题、说明和按钮保持接近的强调程度。</span></button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><small>方案 B</small><b>先突出一个重点</b><span>让主标题和主要操作先被看到。</span></button></div></div><div class=\"learning-observe-action\"><p>切换两个方案看完效果，再选择更适合当前页面的方向。</p><button class=\"learning-choose\" type=\"button\">选择这个方向<i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div></section></div></div></main>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/vibehub-skill/lab"}